    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweet Spring Festival - A simple and beautiful jigsaw puzzle game themed on the Chinese New Year. Five girls celebrate the New Year with you in different ways. The game has relaxing music accompaniment. After completing the level, you can enjoy the girls' photos in the gallery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The game has three difficulties</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Press the &quot;F&quot; key to open the black and white image during puzzle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Players can complete the puzzle by pressing the 'space' key during the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Players can press the AD key, left and right keys or mouse left and right keys to quickly view girl pictures in the gallery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Puzzle image size is 800x960 px</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Gallery image size is 1088x960 px</p>",
